{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enqueue","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"effect","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"When","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":" == "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"ResultType","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Statoscope6EffectP10ResultTypeQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/Statoscope\/documentation\/Statoscope\/Effect\/ResultType"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Statoscope\/documentation\/Statoscope\/Effect","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Effect","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Statoscope6EffectP"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"effect","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A container of an async operation to be executed.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It must complete with an appropriate When case","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Please note enqueueing an effect is just adding it to a list of pending effects. Does not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"immediately trigger it. However EffectsState is provided in the update method and right"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after method is completed, the enqueued effects will be triggered"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Usage","level":3,"text":"Usage","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use it with an anonymous Effect","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["effectsController.enqueue(","  AnyEffect {","    let resultDTO = try JSONDecoder().decode(DTO.self, from: try await URLSession.shared.data(for: request).0)","    return When.networkPostCompleted(resultDTO)","  }",")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Or created a typed Effect"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct NetworkEffect<Response: Decodable>: Effect {","  let request: URLRequest","  func runEffect() async throws -> Response {","    try JSONDecoder().decode(Response.self, from: try await URLSession.shared.data(for: request).0)","  }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"And use it mapping the result to your When case"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["effectsController.enqueue(","  let url = URL(string: \"http:\/\/statoscope.com\")!","  var request = URLRequest(url: url)","  request.setValue(\"application\/json\", forHTTPHeaderField: \"Content-Type\")","  request.httpMethod = \"POST\"","  request.httpBody = try JSONEncoder().encode(dto)","  return NetworkEffect(request)","     .map(When.networkPostCompleted)",")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enqueue","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"externalID":"s:10Statoscope12EffectsStateV7enqueueyyqd__10ResultTypeQyd__RszAA6EffectRd__lF","modules":[{"name":"Statoscope"}],"title":"enqueue(_:)"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/statoscope\/effectsstate\/enqueue(_:)"]}],"hierarchy":{"path